WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.901 --> 00:00:02.133
-Welcome back, everybody!

00:00:02.133 --> 00:00:04.634
It is time to play
"Can You Feel It?"

00:00:04.634 --> 00:00:06.133
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:06.133 --> 00:00:11.300
-♪ Can You Feel It ♪

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:12.634
-But I'm gonna need some help.

00:00:12.634 --> 00:00:15.300
Her movie "Puss In Boots:
The Last Wish"

00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:17.801
opens in theaters December 21st.

00:00:17.801 --> 00:00:20.901
Please welcome
Salma Hayek Pinault!

00:00:20.901 --> 00:00:22.901
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:22.901 --> 00:00:25.901
-I mean, come on!

00:00:25.901 --> 00:00:27.367
Stop it. Mwah!

00:00:27.367 --> 00:00:28.701
-Hi, guys!
-Mwah!

00:00:28.701 --> 00:00:29.834
-Come on.
-Hello!

00:00:29.834 --> 00:00:31.334
-That's what I'm talking about.

00:00:31.334 --> 00:00:32.334
Yes!

00:00:32.334 --> 00:00:33.734
-Yes!
-Alright, now...

00:00:33.734 --> 00:00:35.901
-Let's go!
-I'm so happy you're here.

00:00:35.901 --> 00:00:37.234
And thank you for playing
this game.

00:00:37.234 --> 00:00:38.901
Here's how it works --
we're gonna have a number

00:00:38.901 --> 00:00:41.400
of mystery objects brought out
to us, in front of us.

00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:43.400
Our job is to guess
what each one is.

00:00:43.400 --> 00:00:46.234
The catch is that we have to
figure it out by touch alone.

00:00:46.234 --> 00:00:47.567
You cannot see it.

00:00:47.567 --> 00:00:49.400
You ready for this?

00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:50.567
[ Laughter ]

00:00:50.567 --> 00:00:51.734
Are you scared?

00:00:51.734 --> 00:00:53.400
-I'm going over
the -- the rules.

00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:55.901
-Okay, yeah, yeah.
Just -- just, you feel it.

00:00:55.901 --> 00:00:57.400
And whatever you feel,
you guess what it is.

00:00:57.400 --> 00:00:58.567
-Okay, okay, okay.

00:00:58.567 --> 00:01:01.467
-Salma, since I'm the host,
I'll go first.

00:01:01.467 --> 00:01:02.801
-Yes, yes.
-No! What?!

00:01:02.801 --> 00:01:04.968
No, normally, it's,
"I'm the host, you go first."

00:01:04.968 --> 00:01:06.801
-Ladies first.

00:01:06.801 --> 00:01:09.133
-Let's get our first object.

00:01:09.133 --> 00:01:10.667
Okay, I have 30 seconds...

00:01:10.667 --> 00:01:12.000
[ Laughter ]

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:13.501
...to identify...

00:01:13.501 --> 00:01:15.334
[ Laughter ]

00:01:15.334 --> 00:01:17.334
-Can I...?
-You can look at it, yeah.

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:25.467
[ Laughter ]

00:01:25.467 --> 00:01:26.534
-[ Shouts ]

00:01:26.534 --> 00:01:27.701
-[ Laughs ]

00:01:27.701 --> 00:01:29.868
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:29.868 --> 00:01:31.200
-Aaaah!

00:01:31.200 --> 00:01:32.534
-Come on, Jimmy.
You can do this.

00:01:32.534 --> 00:01:34.534
-I know, I know, I understand.
I hate this so much.

00:01:34.534 --> 00:01:36.200
[ Laughter and cheers ]

00:01:38.667 --> 00:01:41.501
[ Inhaling sharply ]

00:01:41.501 --> 00:01:43.501
Yo! Stop. Stop.

00:01:43.501 --> 00:01:44.501
Questlove, stop it.

00:01:44.501 --> 00:01:45.701
-It moves.
-No!

00:01:45.701 --> 00:01:47.100
What do you mean it moves?
-Come on, come on.

00:01:47.100 --> 00:01:48.434
You're running out of time.
-I know, I know.

00:01:48.434 --> 00:01:49.834
-Go in there.

00:01:49.834 --> 00:01:52.000
[ Scattered screaming ]

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:54.000
[ Laughter ]

00:01:54.000 --> 00:02:01.000
♪♪

00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:02.834
[ Shouts ]

00:02:05.834 --> 00:02:07.334
-Oh, Elf on the Shelf!

00:02:07.334 --> 00:02:08.834
[ Bell dinging ]

00:02:08.834 --> 00:02:11.634
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:11.634 --> 00:02:14.801
Why is it moving?
They don't move.

00:02:14.801 --> 00:02:16.133
They don't --
Why is that moving?

00:02:16.133 --> 00:02:17.334
They don't normally move.
-That was so easy.

00:02:17.334 --> 00:02:19.400
That was so easy.
-That's -- that is ridiculous.

00:02:19.400 --> 00:02:21.567
They don't normally move.
This is -- You're -- That's --

00:02:21.567 --> 00:02:23.234
Whoever's in trouble
is in trouble.

00:02:23.234 --> 00:02:25.234
That's -- that's the first time
I think I ever guessed one.

00:02:25.234 --> 00:02:26.634
-No, they move.
That's the whole point.

00:02:26.634 --> 00:02:27.767
They move from place to place.
-I know, but we --

00:02:27.767 --> 00:02:28.767
-Oh, that's true.
They do. They fly.

00:02:28.767 --> 00:02:30.267
-No?
-Yes, yes.

00:02:30.267 --> 00:02:31.501
Salma, here we go.
This is for you.

00:02:31.501 --> 00:02:33.634
It should be just as nice
as an Elf on the Shelf.

00:02:33.634 --> 00:02:36.434
-Okay.
-Yeah, it's very easy.

00:02:36.434 --> 00:02:38.434
[ Audience ohs ]

00:02:39.501 --> 00:02:41.167
-Okay.

00:02:41.167 --> 00:02:43.167
-Mmph!

00:02:43.167 --> 00:02:45.167
Wait, why are you so --
what are you doing?

00:02:45.167 --> 00:02:46.667
[ Laughter ]
What is wrong with you?

00:02:46.667 --> 00:02:48.667
What are you --
What are you --

00:02:48.667 --> 00:02:50.801
You're just throwing it around.
What are you doing?

00:02:50.801 --> 00:02:52.801
You just -- you can't...
[ Laughter ]

00:02:52.801 --> 00:02:54.133
-Music box.

00:02:54.133 --> 00:02:55.634
-Yes, it's a music box.
[ Bell dinging ]

00:02:55.634 --> 00:02:56.801
Yeah, very good.
-Is it? Is it?

00:02:56.801 --> 00:02:57.901
-What's wrong with you?

00:02:57.901 --> 00:03:00.634
[ Cheers and applause ]
-Bring it on.

00:03:00.634 --> 00:03:03.467
Is it a music box?
-Is there scarier ones?

00:03:03.467 --> 00:03:04.868
Is there scarier ones
for Salma?

00:03:04.868 --> 00:03:06.167
-I broke it.

00:03:06.167 --> 00:03:08.000
-I feel like we might have to
switch up the order here

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:09.033
to make sure, yeah.
-Yeah, yeah.

00:03:09.033 --> 00:03:10.734
Give me something
more challenging.

00:03:10.734 --> 00:03:12.734
-Yes, you just went right in
there and threw it around.

00:03:12.734 --> 00:03:14.567
There's a poor little
ice skater there.

00:03:14.567 --> 00:03:16.934
[ Laughter ]
Alright, here we go.

00:03:16.934 --> 00:03:18.434
[ Audience ohs ]

00:03:18.434 --> 00:03:20.601
[ Laughter ]

00:03:20.601 --> 00:03:22.601
-Nah, nothing.
-Nothing?

00:03:22.601 --> 00:03:24.133
-Piece of cake.
You can get this.

00:03:24.133 --> 00:03:25.634
-Nothing.
-Dig in there.

00:03:25.634 --> 00:03:26.801
Dig in there, Jimmy.

00:03:26.801 --> 00:03:28.801
[ Laughter ]

00:03:28.801 --> 00:03:33.367
♪♪

00:03:33.367 --> 00:03:34.868
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:03:34.868 --> 00:03:36.300
[ Audience cheering ]

00:03:38.267 --> 00:03:40.100
-[ Screaming ]

00:03:40.100 --> 00:03:41.868
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:41.868 --> 00:03:44.968
[ Screaming ]

00:03:44.968 --> 00:03:47.467
-What is it?
You're running out of time.

00:03:47.467 --> 00:03:48.834
What is it?
You're running out of time.

00:03:48.834 --> 00:03:50.167
-I'm bleeding, I'm bleeding!

00:03:50.167 --> 00:03:51.167
[ Laughter ]

00:03:51.167 --> 00:03:54.000
[ Screaming ]

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:55.501
Ketchup?

00:03:55.501 --> 00:03:56.667
Sriracha?

00:03:56.667 --> 00:03:57.834
-You're almost there.

00:03:57.834 --> 00:03:59.000
-Cocktail sauce?

00:03:59.000 --> 00:04:00.067
Shrimp?

00:04:00.067 --> 00:04:03.234
-Yes!
[ Bell dinging ]

00:04:03.234 --> 00:04:05.234
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:09.200 --> 00:04:11.033
-Do we have, like, a bucket,
just in case?

00:04:11.033 --> 00:04:12.367
-Now smell your finger.

00:04:12.367 --> 00:04:14.200
-No, I'm not -- I'm not --
[ Laughter ]

00:04:14.200 --> 00:04:15.601
-You did touch that shrimp.
-What's wrong with you?

00:04:15.601 --> 00:04:16.767
I'm not playing --
that's a different game.

00:04:16.767 --> 00:04:17.934
I'm not playing that.
[ Laughter ]

00:04:17.934 --> 00:04:19.100
Now look, here's...

00:04:19.100 --> 00:04:20.100
Salma, you're up right now.

00:04:20.100 --> 00:04:21.267
Here.
-Okay.

00:04:21.267 --> 00:04:22.667
-Just gonna save --
-Oh, there's a skater.

00:04:22.667 --> 00:04:24.334
-There's a skater from when
you destroyed that last one.

00:04:24.334 --> 00:04:25.767
Yeah, here you go.

00:04:25.767 --> 00:04:27.033
Alright.

00:04:27.033 --> 00:04:28.367
Alright, here we go.
Let me see.

00:04:28.367 --> 00:04:29.501
♪ Ba-ba-dah ba-dah ♪

00:04:29.501 --> 00:04:30.667
Oh, no! Hold on a second!

00:04:30.667 --> 00:04:33.667
No, wait -- No, that's the --

00:04:33.667 --> 00:04:36.000
-[ Speaking Spanish ]

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:39.501
[ Laughter ]

00:04:39.501 --> 00:04:40.667
-No!

00:04:40.667 --> 00:04:42.501
[ Laughter ]

00:04:42.501 --> 00:04:46.334
-It's a cake with a...
brush...

00:04:46.334 --> 00:04:47.667
Oh, my God.
-Oh, my God.

00:04:47.667 --> 00:04:49.000
What are you doing?

00:04:49.000 --> 00:04:50.167
That was it.

00:04:50.167 --> 00:04:52.000
-This is disgusting.
-How did I get --?

00:04:52.000 --> 00:04:55.133
[ Bell dinging ]

00:04:55.133 --> 00:04:57.300
-This is a disas--
What are you...?

00:04:57.300 --> 00:04:58.801
-[ Speaking Spanish ]

00:04:58.801 --> 00:05:01.200
-"A piece of cake with a brush."
What's going...

00:05:01.200 --> 00:05:02.367
-I got it right.

00:05:02.367 --> 00:05:03.534
-No, you...

00:05:03.534 --> 00:05:05.067
[ Cheers and applause ]
What?!

00:05:05.067 --> 00:05:06.901
-Yeah, it's a cake with a brush.

00:05:06.901 --> 00:05:08.501
I smelled it.
This is cake.

00:05:08.501 --> 00:05:09.901
-Is that what that is?

00:05:09.901 --> 00:05:11.567
A toothbrush with icing on it?
-It's the top of the cake.

00:05:11.567 --> 00:05:14.734
-Here, wipe this off.
-Ay, this is toothpaste?

00:05:14.734 --> 00:05:16.067
[ Laughter ]
-Yeah.

00:05:16.067 --> 00:05:17.567
Here, here. Take this.

00:05:17.567 --> 00:05:19.901
Sorry. Salma, I'm sorry.
-It's King Kong's toothbrush,

00:05:19.901 --> 00:05:21.734
because that's not the normal...

00:05:21.734 --> 00:05:23.901
-[ Laughs ]
King Kong's toothbrush.

00:05:23.901 --> 00:05:25.567
Oh, Salma, get ready.

00:05:25.567 --> 00:05:27.868
This is time for the final --
-But I got the brush part.

00:05:27.868 --> 00:05:30.000
-Yeah, the judges said that --
-Do I get half a point?

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:31.200
-Yeah, yeah, you got half.
[ Bell dings ]

00:05:31.200 --> 00:05:33.367
-We're both gonna get
the same item here, okay?

00:05:33.367 --> 00:05:36.534
And the first person to guess it
wins all the points on this one.

00:05:36.534 --> 00:05:37.868
-Okay.
-Yes, but -- wait.

00:05:37.868 --> 00:05:39.033
-I'm listening.
I'm paying attention.

00:05:39.033 --> 00:05:40.868
-Okay.
-I'm still cleaning the nails.

00:05:40.868 --> 00:05:41.868
-You're still cleaning
your nails?

00:05:41.868 --> 00:05:42.868
Alright, ready?

00:05:42.868 --> 00:05:44.200
We can do this.
-Okay.

00:05:44.200 --> 00:05:45.300
-Do you want to go on this side

00:05:45.300 --> 00:05:46.667
and I'll go from that side?
-No, no.

00:05:46.667 --> 00:05:48.501
[ Audience exclaims ]

00:05:50.000 --> 00:05:51.501
-It's moving.

00:05:53.567 --> 00:05:55.234
Did you move it?

00:05:55.234 --> 00:05:59.167
♪♪

00:05:59.167 --> 00:06:01.067
[ Audience oohs ]

00:06:01.067 --> 00:06:07.467
♪♪

00:06:07.467 --> 00:06:09.467
Oh, oh! Hey!

00:06:09.467 --> 00:06:11.901
That's your hand!
-It's a hand, for sure.

00:06:11.901 --> 00:06:13.567
-Oh, my God. It is a hand.

00:06:13.567 --> 00:06:15.234
There's someone in there.
[ Bell dinging ]

00:06:15.234 --> 00:06:18.567
Oh, my God. Watch out.
Watch out. Oh, my God.

00:06:18.567 --> 00:06:21.234
Thing! It is...
Wow, sorry about that.

00:06:21.234 --> 00:06:23.067
-Oh, that was so easy.
-He's very strong.

00:06:23.067 --> 00:06:25.234
It is Thing from --
-Give me a five.

00:06:25.234 --> 00:06:27.100
-They can't see.
...Addam's Family.

00:06:27.100 --> 00:06:28.267
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:06:28.267 --> 00:06:31.267
You are so...
Nothing scares you.

00:06:31.267 --> 00:06:34.234
Salma Hayek Pinault,
everybody -- the champ!

00:06:34.234 --> 00:06:37.734
[ Cheers and applause ]
Unbelievable, you are so good.

00:06:37.734 --> 00:06:40.234
We'll be right back with more
Salma after the break.

00:06:40.234 --> 00:06:42.067
Let's get that out of your nails
right there.

00:06:42.067 --> 00:06:44.601
-♪ I walk across this world
that's deceptive ♪

00:06:44.601 --> 00:06:46.634
♪ Beats are perfected,
